sequenceDiagram
    participant Review as Architecture Review
    participant Net as Network
    participant Sec as Monitor/KeyVault
    participant Data as Storage/Eventing/ADX
    participant ML as Azure ML
    participant AI as Foundry/Search
    participant Gov as Purview/Power BI
    participant Val as Validation

    Review->>Net: approve parameters
    Net->>Sec: deploy baseline controls
    Sec->>Data: deploy data platform
    Data->>ML: deploy ML blueprint
    ML->>AI: deploy AI blueprint
    AI->>Gov: configure governance/reporting mapping
    Gov->>Val: run smoke tests and readiness gates
